# staging-anon-probe.targets — what the daily probe requests (installed to /etc/revhero/, never overwritten once it exists).
#
# One target per line:   <https-base-url>  <path>  <family>
# Every request is an UNAUTHENTICATED GET. Every route below must answer 401 or 403 to a caller with no credentials.
#
# RULES for adding a line (the script enforces the first; the rest are on you):
#   1. STAGING ONLY. A host that is not a staging domain (*.test.revhero.io, *.staging2.revhero.io, *.staging.revhero.ai,
#      *.test.revhero.ai) makes the whole probe refuse to run. Prod hosts can never be added.
#   2. READ-ONLY LIST ROUTES ONLY. Some GETs in this fleet TRIGGER WORK when reachable: deal-mover GET /v1/sweeper/run,
#      deals-actions GET /v1/actions/linkedin-enrich-sweep, /derive-websites, /reconcile-scrape-links, /fire-on-resolve.
#      Never list one: an open route would run it. If in doubt, read the handler.
#   3. Use a NONEXISTENT tenant wherever a route takes an id (999999999), so an open route has nothing to return.
#   4. A route that is open ON PURPOSE (a webhook, a public page, the unauthenticated GET /v1/supported-crms/account-by-crm-user
#      leftover) does not belong here: it would alert every day. Remove it, or fix it.
#
# Routes were read from origin/staging of each service on 2026-11-22. A route that moves answers 404, which the probe
# reports as "absent" (not proof of auth) and counts against MIN_EVALUATED_PCT, so drift shows up instead of hiding.
#
# families: users, campaigns, deals, inbox, admin (plus documents / other where the service has none of those).

# ---- BFF (user-fe-backend): every protected /v1 route sits behind JWTAuth(). Three public hosts for the same app. ----
https://api.staging.revhero.ai               /v1/user/profile                  users
https://api.staging.revhero.ai               /v1/account/users                 users
https://api.staging.revhero.ai               /v1/campaigns/list                campaigns
https://api.staging.revhero.ai               /v1/deals/filter                  deals
https://api.staging.revhero.ai               /v1/inbox/conversations           inbox
https://api.staging.revhero.ai               /v1/inbox/counts                  inbox
https://api.staging.revhero.ai               /v1/admin/users/all               admin
https://api.staging.revhero.ai               /v1/admin/dashboard/stats         admin

https://user-fe-backend.test.revhero.io      /v1/user/profile                  users
https://user-fe-backend.test.revhero.io      /v1/account/users                 users
https://user-fe-backend.test.revhero.io      /v1/campaigns/list                campaigns
https://user-fe-backend.test.revhero.io      /v1/deals/filter                  deals
https://user-fe-backend.test.revhero.io      /v1/inbox/conversations           inbox
https://user-fe-backend.test.revhero.io      /v1/inbox/counts                  inbox
https://user-fe-backend.test.revhero.io      /v1/admin/users/all               admin
https://user-fe-backend.test.revhero.io      /v1/admin/dashboard/stats         admin

# Lane 2 (staging-2) BFF.
https://api.staging2.revhero.io              /v1/user/profile                  users
https://api.staging2.revhero.io              /v1/account/users                 users
https://api.staging2.revhero.io              /v1/campaigns/list                campaigns
https://api.staging2.revhero.io              /v1/deals/filter                  deals
https://api.staging2.revhero.io              /v1/inbox/conversations           inbox
https://api.staging2.revhero.io              /v1/inbox/counts                  inbox
https://api.staging2.revhero.io              /v1/admin/users/all               admin
https://api.staging2.revhero.io              /v1/admin/dashboard/stats         admin

# ---- Internal services that also have a public staging host (the U18 prod edge lock does NOT cover these) ----
# users-service (code gates: InternalServicesAuth on holidays / active-hours, #244)
https://users-service.test.revhero.io        /v1/holidays/user/999999999              users
https://users-service.test.revhero.io        /v1/active-hours/user/999999999          users
https://users-service.test.revhero.io        /v1/credit/user/999999999                users
https://users-service.test.revhero.io        /v1/account/accounts/user/999999999      users

# campaign-service (PublicEdgeGuard + InternalServicesAuthGraceable; INTERNAL_AUTH_ENFORCE is log-only on lane 1)
https://campaign-service.test.revhero.io     /v1/campaigns                     campaigns
https://campaign-service.test.revhero.io     /v1/deals/filter                  deals

# sms-service (InternalServicesAuthGraceable)
https://sms-service.test.revhero.io          /v1/messages/conversations        inbox
https://sms-service.test.revhero.io          /v1/phone-numbers/user/999999999  users

# email-ingress. /v1/emails validates ParentUserID as required: asked without it, an anonymous caller got a 400 from the
# handler (no auth in front of it, 2026-11-22), so the parameter is sent to reach a conclusive answer.
# The second route is behind the HARD gate: a control that must always be refused.
https://email-ingress.test.revhero.io        /v1/emails?parent_user_id=999999999   inbox
https://email-ingress.test.revhero.io        /v1/internal/inbox-feed/emails    inbox

# deals-actions: ONLY the list route. The other GETs in this group trigger work (see rule 2).
https://deals-actions-service.test.revhero.io  /v1/actions/pending-bookings    deals

# hubspot / pipedrive CRM adapters (ParentUserID is a required query parameter, as on email-ingress)
https://hubspot-service.test.revhero.io      /v1/campaigns?parent_user_id=999999999    campaigns
https://pipedrive-service.test.revhero.io    /v1/campaigns?parent_user_id=999999999    campaigns

# cloud-documents (hard InternalSecretAuth on the whole group)
https://cloud-documents-service.test.revhero.io  /v1/upload/providers          documents

# analytics: the dashboard read family has had NO auth (known leftover, follow-up 2.23); /dashboard/clients is super-admin.
# The dashboard routes require from, to (YYYY-MM-DD) and account_id; a 2020 window for a nonexistent tenant returns nothing.
https://internal-analytics.test.revhero.io   /v1/analytics/dashboard?parent_user_id=999999999&account_id=999999999&from=2020-01-01&to=2020-01-02          campaigns
https://internal-analytics.test.revhero.io   /v1/analytics/dashboard/summary?parent_user_id=999999999&account_id=999999999&from=2020-01-01&to=2020-01-02  campaigns
https://internal-analytics.test.revhero.io   /v1/analytics/dashboard/clients   admin
